  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\nThis product contains all the necessary hardware components for assembling a <strong>Mini Motorized Basketball Game</strong>. To complete the assembly for an entirely functional piece, users also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\" style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\">To download the model files of <strong>Mini Motorized Basketball Game </strong>and obtain detailed information, please visit the <strong>Mini Motorized Basketball Game</strong> on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/zh/models/420464?from=search#profileId-323162\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><u>MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a>.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第三条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">In the Box</h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 274.313px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody><!-- 第一行 --><!-- 第二行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"he